# Keep .git so the multi-stage build can clone historical demo-* refs.

.demo
# Re-include the merged docroot specifically: Dockerfile.serve COPYs
# .demo/_serve from the build context (the workflow pre-stages it via
# downloaded artifacts). The rest of .demo (per-builder build trees,
# clone artifacts) stays out.
!.demo/_serve
.cache
tmp
**/node_modules
# Per-build mkdocs config emitted by examples/mkdocs/build.sh
**/.mkdocs-versioned.yml
**/.vuepress/.temp
**/.vuepress/.cache
**/.astro
**/.docusaurus
**/.hugo_build.lock
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.env
.env.local
.claude/settings.local.json
